<div style="font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:23px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:bold;color:#FFFFFF;padding-top:10px;">Your pandas merge might be duplicating rows</div>
</td></tr>

<tr><td bgcolor="#FFD23F" style="background:#FFD23F;padding:8px 22px;border-bottom:3px solid #111111;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.4;color:#111111;"><b>New here?</b> Every mail ends with a riddle, and the answer opens the next mail.</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:14px 22px 0;"><div style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:bold;color:#5F5A52;padding-bottom:3px;">THE PROBLEM</div><div style="font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#111111;">A join on a key that is not unique quietly multiplies rows, and every total after it is wrong.</div></td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:12px 22px 0;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td bgcolor="#FFFBEA" style="background:#FFFBEA;border:3px solid #111111;padding:11px 14px 6px;"><div style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:bold;color:#111111;padding-bottom:3px;">TRY THIS</div>
<div style="font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:bold;color:#111111;padding-bottom:9px;">Add <span style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:15px;background:#F2EFE8;color:#111111;padding:0 4px;border:1px solid #DDD6C8;">validate="many_to_one"</span> (or <span style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:15px;background:#F2EFE8;color:#111111;padding:0 4px;border:1px solid #DDD6C8;">"one_to_one"</span>) to <span style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:15px;background:#F2EFE8;color:#111111;padding:0 4px;border:1px solid #DDD6C8;">pd.merge</span> so pandas raises an error when the keys are not unique.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="26" valign="top" style="padding:0 9px 6px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="20" height="20" align="center" bgcolor="#FFD23F" style="background:#FFD23F;border:2px solid #111111;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#111111;">1</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top" style="padding:1px 0 6px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#111111;">Find a <span style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#F2EFE8;color:#111111;padding:0 4px;border:1px solid #DDD6C8;">pd.merge</span> in your current notebook</td></tr><tr><td width="26" valign="top" style="padding:0 9px 6px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="20" height="20" align="center" bgcolor="#FFD23F" style="background:#FFD23F;border:2px solid #111111;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#111111;">2</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top" style="padding:1px 0 6px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#111111;">Add <span style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#F2EFE8;color:#111111;padding:0 4px;border:1px solid #DDD6C8;">validate="many_to_one"</span> if the right table should have unique keys</td></tr><tr><td width="26" valign="top" style="padding:0 9px 6px 0;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="20" height="20" align="center" bgcolor="#FFD23F" style="background:#FFD23F;border:2px solid #111111;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#111111;">3</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top" style="padding:1px 0 6px;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#111111;">Add <span style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#F2EFE8;color:#111111;padding:0 4px;border:1px solid #DDD6C8;">indicator=True</span> and check the <span style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:13px;background:#F2EFE8;color:#111111;padding:0 4px;border:1px solid #DDD6C8;">_merge</span> column for unmatched rows</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>

