<td valign="middle" style="border-left:4px solid #FFD23F;padding:2px 0 2px 12px;"><div style="font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:bold;color:#5F5A52;padding-bottom:3px;">WHY IT MATTERS</div><div style="font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#111111;">Catch silent row blow-ups before they reach a report.</div></td>
